# Refactoring Skill

Based on Martin Fowler (Refactoring)

## Principles

- Refactoring must not change behavior
- Work in small steps
- Keep code always functional

## Techniques

- Extract function
- Rename variables
- Remove duplication
- Simplify conditionals

## Safety

- Only refactor with confidence (tests or clear reasoning)
- If unsure, stop and ask

## Cursor Behavior

- Never mix refactor with feature/fix
- Keep changes small and reviewable

## Sources

- Refactoring – Martin Fowler
